title: Coalition Affairs
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; coalition_affairs_timer = 5
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent >= 1 and coalition_affairs_timer = 0 and (in_republican_socialist_conjunction or in_left_republican_coalition or in_popular_front)
card-image: img/sansebastianpact.jpg
#subtitle: There is dissent within our coalition.

= Coalition Affairs

Our coalition is in trouble. The right-leaning members of the Radical [? if in_republican_socialist_conjunction: PRR ?] [? if in_left_republican_coalition or in_popular_front: Socialist PRRS ?] are constantly criticizing us for our policies, and are threatening to call a vote of no confidence to collapse this government.

How do we reduce tensions with the coalition?

- @promise_cuts: Agree to the bourgeois plans to cut welfare.
- @resources: Use our party resources to support our allies.
- @bring_down: Instead, we will bring down the government with a no-confidence vote, and call for new elections.
- @no_change: Take none of these actions.
- @easy_discard


@promise_cuts
on-arrival: workers_psoe -= 5; unemployed_psoe -= 6; workers_pce += 3; workers_ap += 2; unemployed_pce += 3; unemployed_ap += 3; caballeristas_dissent += 10; besteiristas_dissent += 5; welfare -= 1; budget += 1; coalition_dissent = 0

Fine. By cutting welfare, we have reduced dissent within the coalition.

@resources
subtitle: -2 resources
view-if: historical_mode = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources (need 2).
choose-if: resources >= 2
on-arrival: resources -= 2; coalition_dissent -= 1

By transferring campaign funds to our coalition partners, we can make our policies more acceptable to them. Some would call this corruption, but perhaps it is necessary to save the <span style="color: #E3000F;">re</span><span style="color: #D5AC27;">pub</span><span style="color: #8845ba;">lic</span>.

@no_change

No. We will not do this.

@bring_down
subtitle: Bring down this government before our opponents do.
on-arrival: psoe_in_government = 0; chancellor = "Casares Quiroga"; chancellor_party = ar_name; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; caballeristas_strength += 8; pro_republic -= 5; rural_psoe -= 2; middle_psoe -= 5; catholics_psoe -= 3; prietistas_dissent += 5; in_republican_socialist_conjunction = 0; in_popular_front = 0; in_left_front = 0; in_left_republican_coalition = 0; in_emergency_government = 0; in_psoe_majority = 0; in_minority_government = 0

We have called for a vote of no confidence in ourselves, and have brought down this government. Chancellor [+ chancellor +] currently rules as acting president of the government.

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

